{"id":"memorial_105201","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105200","label":"Data · Tower to the Gods?.txt"},"label":"001.txt","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_105202","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105201_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"Lately, something's been off about the V.T.C. guys."},{"id":"memorial_105201_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"They've been snapping up huge stretches of barren land no one was using, throwing up high walls around it, and digging like crazy."},{"id":"memorial_105201_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"Security out there is tighter than it needs to be."},{"id":"memorial_105201_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"There are even rumors that V.T.C.'s leader has been on-site."},{"id":"memorial_105201_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"What is this?"},{"id":"memorial_105201_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"What the hell are they hiding out there?"},{"id":"memorial_105201_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"The scale alone doesn't make sense... They're using way too much land."},{"id":"memorial_105201_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"Are they building some kind of new religious facility?"},{"id":"memorial_105201_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"If that's all it was, there'd be no reason to keep it under wraps."},{"id":"memorial_105201_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"No matter how I look at it, something's off."},{"id":"memorial_105201_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"Twenty years in this business, and my gut's telling me that..."},{"id":"memorial_105201_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_01_description","text":"there's something there."}]}